# Chapter II-III, the galleon: a guard taunts the prisoner and drops a note,
# the stranger from the tavern sits in the next cell, and a nightmare of a
# burning city ends in a bang on deck. The ship is sinking; Admiral Smilias
# bars the way to the deck, and a rowboat carries the player to Arktrand.
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the walks, the console's damageav for
# the fight with Smilias; ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from galeone_guard
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# The guard walks past the cell, taunts the player and lets a paper fall.
case galeone_guard
until 900 Storyvar == 9
wait 60
ask Where you're going
choose 1
choose 4
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_Galeone == 2
end

# The paper in the walkway.
case galeone_note
activate GaleoneZettel01
close Book Menu
expect GetJournalIndex A_II_Galeone == 7
end

# The stranger from the tavern, in the next cell.
case galeone_messenger
talk GaleoneBote01
ask found and captured
choose 1
choose 3
choose 5
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_III_Bote == 2
end

# Sleep on the straw brings the nightmare of the burning city, and a bang on
# deck wakes the player.
case galeone_dream
activate 053180C5
button 0
until 300 Storyvar == 10
button 0
until 900 Storyvar == 12
until 600 GetPCCell "Galleon, Cells" == 1
end

# Below decks, the hold is filling with water.
case galeone_sinking
run
player->PositionCell -425 -29 -23 180 "Galleon, Lower Level"
until 600 "MarkerGaleone02".State == 1
end

# Admiral Smilias would rather sink with his ship.
case galeone_smilias
run
player->PositionCell -1348 260 6 180 "Galleon, Upper deck"
wait 120
ask rather sink
choose 2
choose 3
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_III_Smilias == 1
console 05EE4DF7.damageav health 10000
until 300 "AdmiralSmilias"->GetHealth <= 0
end

# The rowboat on deck carries the player to land -- the boat's own script
# moves it, and the player with it -- and the player steps off onto the shore.
case galeone_rowboat
run
player->PositionCell 2662 6104 269 0 "Galleon, Deck"
until 600 GetPCCell "Galleon, Deck" == 1
activate GaleoneRuderboot01
until 600 Storyvar == 13
until 6000 "a_Galeone_Ruderboot_02".State == 3
run
player->Position -79052 24500 30 180
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_III_Arktrand == 1
expect Storyvar == 15
end
